  '<p class="gd-p">Your day, in order: handovers, returns, deliveries, moves and photo shoots. Each job card has the car, the plate, the place and the time.</p><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-your-job-list" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your job list</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">The menu: <b class="gd-ui">My jobs</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Report a problem</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add a rental</b>, <b class="gd-ui">My sales</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Referrals</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. <b class="gd-ui">Sign out</b> is top right.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Switch between <b class="gd-ui">Today</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Tomorrow</b>. Jobs are in time order.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">The next job is the big card at the top: its time and how long until it, the car and its plate, the place with <b class="gd-ui">Open in maps</b> and a button to call the renter, and what to put in the car. The rest of the day follows in time order.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">A handover or a return has its own button: <b class="gd-ui">Check out (pickup)</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Check in (return)</b>. One tap acknowledges and starts the job and opens its photo checklist. Other jobs: press <b class="gd-ui">Open the job</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Moving a car that has no job? Use Vehicle moves (see below).</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/945"><img src="/guides/img/field-01-today-phone-421eca90.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="945"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:7.7%;top:19.6%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:76.9%;top:27.5%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:89.7%;top:37%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:88.5%;top:46.6%" aria-hidden="true">4</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:76.9%;top:56.3%" aria-hidden="true">5</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Need help on a job? Call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991. The link is at the bottom of My jobs.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-open-a-job" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Open a job</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">The card shows the kind, the time, the car, the plate and colour.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">The address, with <b class="gd-ui">Open in maps</b> for directions, and a button to call the renter.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">For a handover: the booking, the renter&#39;s name and phone, the Card on File and the licence on file.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Acknowledge</b> so the office knows you have it. Then press <b class="gd-ui">Start</b> when you are with the car.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/635"><img src="/guides/img/field-02-job-phone-a0feec93.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="635"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:51.2%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:64.3%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:79.5%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:94.9%;top:93.9%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-check-the-renter-s-licence" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Check the renter&#39;s licence</h2><p class="gd-p">The renter&#39;s licence photos and selfie are checked before the handover. You can check them yourself, for a booking on one of your own jobs today or in the next 7 days. Everything you do is recorded with your name and &quot;field staff&quot;.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">My jobs shows <b class="gd-ui">Licences to check</b> when the licence front, back or selfie of a renter on one of your jobs waits for a decision. The same check is on the job itself, under <b class="gd-ui">Check the licence</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Review the licence</b>. The images open with the name, date of birth and licence details on the booking.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Look at each image: the name and date of birth match the booking, class G2 or G and valid past the return date with no sign of alteration, and the selfie matches the licence photo.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">One is wrong? Open <b class="gd-ui">Reject this one</b> under it, type the reason the renter reads and press <b class="gd-ui">Reject</b>. The renter is told why and sends a new one.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Then press <b class="gd-ui">Approve all</b>: everything still waiting is approved at once.</div></li></ol></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>The renter&#39;s proof of coverage stays with the office. Meeting the renter at the handover? You can still check the original licence in person from the ready check (see A handover).</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-move-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Move a car</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Under Vehicle moves, press <b class="gd-ui">Start a move</b>. Choose the Car and Why (for example Reposition).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Fill in From and the Odometer (km), then press <b class="gd-ui">Start the move now</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">When you arrive, press <b class="gd-ui">End the move</b>, fill in Now at and the odometer, then press <b class="gd-ui">End the move now</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/450"><img src="/guides/img/field-01-today-phone-27dfe7af.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="450"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:87.2%;top:22.2%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:87.2%;top:60.4%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:87.2%;top:93.3%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="my-jobs-documents-to-sign" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Documents to sign</h2><p class="gd-p">Your staff agreement, when CarmaCars sends it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">My jobs shows &quot;You have a document to sign&quot;. Press <b class="gd-ui">Read and sign</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Check the key values at the top (your role, wage and start date), then press <b class="gd-ui">Read the PDF</b> and read it.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Sign</b>. Your full legal name is your signature (or press <b class="gd-ui">Draw instead</b>).</div></li></ol></div></section>');
-- GUIDES 0162 END
